<view class="page"><view class="headline"><text>连接不同地区的招商负责人</text><text>联系人必须挂靠已认证政府或园区组织</text></view><scroll-view scroll-x class="filters"><text wx:for="{{regions}}" wx:key="*this" class="filter {{activeRegion === item ? 'active' : ''}}" data-region="{{item}}" bindtap="chooseRegion">{{item}}</text></scroll-view><view class="contact card" wx:for="{{contacts}}" wx:key="id"><view class="avatar">{{item.name.slice(0, 1)}}</view><view class="contact-body"><view class="org-row"><text>{{item.organizationName}}</text><text class="tag">已认证</text></view><text class="muted">{{item.name}} · {{item.title}}</text><text class="region">{{item.region}}</text><view class="industries"><text wx:for="{{item.industries}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</text></view><button bindtap="contact">申请联系</button></view></view></view>
